        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/jahez/v2/money-movements?page=1&pageSize=50",
        "description": "Optional fromDate and toDate use YYYY-MM-DD and filter occurredAtUtc by inclusive Riyadh calendar days. Omitted fromDate defaults to the current month's first day; omitted toDate defaults to today. Each default applies independently. Example: append &fromDate=2026-10-01&toDate=2026-10-17. Reversed ranges return HTTP 400."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "أرصدة الجهات",
